content:
Chase. Blue scared goats flee from you. Touching a scared goat turns it into a carcass (+1). If another scared goat touches a carcass, it turns orange and angry — angry goats hunt YOU and kill you on contact (-1). Win by catching every scared goat.

Tactic: pick the nearest blue goat and close the distance every single turn — they run away, so trap them against walls and corners instead of following in a straight line. Steer clear of orange goats; if one is closing in, step away first, then resume the hunt.

